[{"title":"","label":"第 65 则","author":"","text":" 文人讲武事，大都纸上谈兵；武将论文章，半属道听途说。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 65 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[64]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 66 则","author":"","text":"斗方止三种可存：佳诗文一也，新题目二也，精款式三也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 66 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[65]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 67 则","author":"","text":"情必近于痴而始真，才必兼乎趣而始化。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 67 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[66]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 68 则","author":"","text":"凡花色之娇媚者，多不甚香；瓣之千层者，多不结实。甚矣！全才之难也！兼之者，其惟莲乎！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 68 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[67]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 69 则","author":"","text":"著得一部新书，便是千秋大业；注得一部古书，允为万世宏功。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 69 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[68]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 70 则","author":"","text":"延名师训子弟，入名山习举业，丐名士代捉刀，三者都无是处。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 70 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[69]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 71 则","author":"","text":"积画以成字，积字以成句，积句以成篇，谓之文。文体日增，至八股而遂止。如古文、如诗、如赋、如词、如曲、如说部、如传奇小说，皆自无而有。方其未有之时，固不料后来之有此一体也。逮既有此一体之后，又若天造地设，为世必应有之物。然自明以来，未见有创一体裁新人耳目者。遥计百年之后，必有其人，惜乎不及见耳！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 71 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[70]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 72 则","author":"","text":" 云映日而成霞，泉挂岩而成瀑。所托者异，而名亦因之。此友道之所以可贵也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 72 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[71]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 73 则","author":"","text":"大家之文，吾爱之慕之，吾愿学之；名家之文，吾爱之慕之，吾不敢学之。学大家而不得，所谓“刻鹄不成尚类鹜”也；学名家而不得，则是“画虎不成反类狗”矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 73 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[72]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 74 则","author":"","text":"由戒得定，由定得慧，勉强渐近自然；炼精化气，炼气化神，清虚有何渣滓！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 74 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[73]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 75 则","author":"","text":"南北东西，一定之位也；前后左右，无定之位也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 75 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[74]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 76 则","author":"","text":"予尝谓二氏不可废，非袭夫大养济院之陈言也。盖名山胜境，我辈每思褰裳就之，使非琳宫梵刹，则倦时无可驻足，饥时谁与授餐！忽有疾风暴雨，五大夫果真足恃乎？又或丘壑深邃，非一日可了。岂能露宿以待明日乎？虎豹蛇虺能保其不为人患乎？又或为士大夫所有，果能不问主人，任我之登陟凭吊，而莫之禁乎？##不特此也。甲之所有，乙思起而夺之，是启争端也。祖父之所创建，子孙贫，力不能修葺。其倾颓之状，反足令山川减色矣。##然此特就名山胜境言之耳。即城市之内，与夫四达之衢，亦不可少此一种。客游可作居停，一也；长途可以稍憩，二也；夏之茗，冬之姜汤，复可以济役夫负戴之困，三也。凡此皆就事理言之，非二氏福报之说也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 76 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[75]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 77 则","author":"","text":"虽不善书，而笔砚不可不精；虽不业医，而验方不可不存；虽不工弈，而楸枰不可不备。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 77 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[76]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 78 则","author":"","text":"方外不必戒酒，但须戒俗；红裙不必通文，但须得趣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 78 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[77]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 79 则","author":"","text":"梅边之石宜古，松下之石宜拙，竹傍之石宜瘦，盆内之石宜巧。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 79 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[78]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 80 则","author":"","text":"律己宜带秋气，处世宜带春气。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 80 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[79]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 81 则","author":"","text":"厌催租之败意，亟宜早早完粮；喜老衲之谈禅，难免常常布施。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 81 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[80]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 82 则","author":"","text":"松下听琴，月下听箫，涧边听瀑布，山中听梵呗，觉耳中别有不同。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 82 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[81]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 83 则","author":"","text":"月下听禅，旨趣益远；月下说剑，肝胆益真；月下论诗，风致益幽；月下对美人，情意益笃。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 83 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[82]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 84 则","author":"","text":"有地上之山水，有画上之山水，有梦中之山水，有胸中之山水。地上者，妙在丘壑深邃；画上者，妙在笔墨淋漓；梦中者，妙在景象变幻；胸中者，妙在位置自如。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 84 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[83]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 85 则","author":"","text":"一日之计种蕉，一岁之计种竹，十年之计种柳，百年之计种松。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 85 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[84]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 86 则","author":"","text":"春雨宜读书，夏雨宜弈棋，秋雨宜检藏，冬雨宜饮酒。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 86 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[85]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 87 则","author":"","text":"诗文之体，得秋气为佳；词曲之体，得春气为佳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 87 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[86]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 88 则","author":"","text":"抄写之笔墨，不必过求其佳；若施之缣素，则不可不求其佳。诵读之书籍，不必过求其备；若以供稽考，则不可不求其备。游历之山水，不必过求其妙；若因之卜居，则不可不求其妙。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 88 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[87]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 89 则","author":"","text":"人非圣贤，安能无所不知！只知其一，惟恐不止其一，复求知其二者，上也；止知其一，因人言始知有其二者，次也；止知其一，人言有其二而莫之信者，又其次也；止知其一，恶人言有其二者，斯下之下矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 89 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[88]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 90 则","author":"","text":"史官所纪者，直世界也；职方所载者，横世界也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 90 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[89]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 91 则","author":"","text":"先天八卦，竖看者也；后天八卦，横看者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 91 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[90]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 92 则","author":"","text":"藏书不难，能看为难；看书不难，能读为难；读书不难，能用为难；能用不难，能记为难。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 92 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[91]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 93 则","author":"","text":"求知己于朋友易，求知己于妻妾难，求知己于君臣则尤难之难。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 93 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[92]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 94 则","author":"","text":"何谓善人？无损于世者，则谓之善人；何谓恶人？有害于世者，则谓之恶人。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 94 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[93]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 95 则","author":"","text":"有工夫读书，谓之福；有力量济人，谓之福；有学问著述，谓之福；无是非到耳，谓之福；有多闻、直谅之友，谓之福。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 95 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[94]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 96 则","author":"","text":"人莫乐于闲，非无所事事之谓也。闲则能读书，闲则能游名胜，闲则能交益友，闲则能饮酒，闲则能著书。天下之乐，孰大于是？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 96 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[95]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 97 则","author":"","text":"文章是案头之山水，山水是地上之文章。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 97 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[96]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 98 则","author":"","text":"平上去入，乃一定之至理。然入声之为字也少，不得谓凡字皆有四声也。世之调平仄者，于入声之无其字者，往往以不相合之音隶于其下。为所隶者，苟无平上去之三声，则是以寡妇配鳏夫，犹之可也。若所隶之字自有其平上去之三声，而欲强以从我，则是干有夫之妇矣，其可乎？姑就诗韵言之，如东、冬韵，无入声者也，今人尽调之以东、董、冻、督。夫督之为音，当附于都、睹、妒之下；若属之于东、董、冻，又何以处夫都、睹、妒乎？若东、都二字俱以督字为入声，则是一妇而两夫矣。三江无入声者也，今人尽调之以江、讲、绛、觉，殊不知觉之为音，当附于交、绞、教之下者也。诸如此类，不胜其举。然则如之何而后可？曰：鳏者听其鳏，寡者听其寡，夫妇全者安其全，各不相干而已矣。（东、冬、欢、桓、寒、山、真、文、元、渊、先、天、庚、青、侵、盐、咸诸部皆无入声者也。屋、沃内如秃、独、鹄、束等字，乃鱼、虞韵，内都、图等字之入声；卜、木、六、仆等字，乃五歌部之入声；玉、菊、狱、育等字，乃尤部之入声；三觉、十药，当属于萧、肴、豪；质、锡、职、缉，当属于支、微、齐。质内之桔、卒，物内之郁、屈，当属于虞、鱼；物内之勿、物等音，无平上去者也；讫、乞等，四支之入声也。陌部乃佳、灰之半，开、来等字之入声也。月部之月、厥、阙、谒等及屑、叶二部，古无平上去，而今则为中州韵内车、遮诸字之入声也。伐、发等字及曷部之括、适及八黠全部，又十五合内诸字，又十七洽全部，皆六麻之入声也。曷内之撮、阔等字，合部之合、盒数字，皆无平上去者也。若以缉、合、叶、洽为闭口韵，则止当谓之无平上去之寡妇，而不当调之以侵、寝、缉、咸、喊、陷、洽也。）","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 98 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[97]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 99 则","author":"","text":"《水浒传》是一部怒书，《西游记》是一部悟书，《金瓶梅》是一部哀书。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 99 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[98]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 100 则","author":"","text":"读书最乐，若读史书，则喜少怒多；究之怒处，亦乐处也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 100 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[99]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 101 则","author":"","text":"发前人未发之论，方是奇书；言妻子难言之情，乃为密友。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 101 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[100]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 102 则","author":"","text":"一介之士，必有密友。密友不必定是刎颈之交。大率虽千百里之遥，皆可相信，而不为浮言所动；闻有谤之者，即多方为之辩析而后已；事之宜行宜止者，代为筹画决断；或事当利害关头，有所需而后济者，即不必与闻，亦不虑其负我与否，竟为力承其事。此皆所谓密友也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 102 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[101]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 103 则","author":"","text":"风流自赏，只容花鸟趋陪；真率谁知？合受烟霞供养。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 103 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[102]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 104 则","author":"","text":"万事可忘，难忘者名心一段；千般易淡，未淡者美酒三杯。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 104 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[103]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 105 则","author":"","text":"芰荷可食，而亦可衣；金石可器，而亦可服。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 105 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[104]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 106 则","author":"","text":"宜于耳，复宜于目者，弹琴也，吹箫也；宜于耳，不宜于目者，吹笙也，擪(ye)管也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 106 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[105]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 107 则","author":"","text":"看晓妆，宜于傅粉之后。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 107 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[106]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 108 则","author":"","text":"我不知我之生前，当春秋之季，曾一识西施否？当典午之时，曾一看卫玠否？当义熙之世，曾一醉渊明否？当天宝之代，曾一睹太真否？当元丰之朝，曾一晤东坡否？##千古之上相思者，不止此数人。而此数人则其尤甚者，故姑举之以概其余也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 108 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[107]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 109 则","author":"","text":"我又不知在隆、万时，曾于旧院中交几名妓？眉公、伯虎、若士、赤水诸君，曾共我谈笑几回？茫茫宇宙，我今当向谁问之耶！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 109 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[108]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 110 则","author":"","text":"文章是有字句之锦绣，锦绣是无字句之文章，两者同出于一原。姑即粗迹论之，如金陵，如武林，如姑苏，书林之所在，即机杼之所在也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 110 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[109]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 111 则","author":"","text":"予尝集诸法帖字为诗，字之不复而多者，莫善于《千字文》。然诗家目前常用之字，犹苦其未备。如天文之烟霞风雪，地理之江山塘岸，时令之春霄晓暮，人物之翁僧渔樵，花木之花柳苔萍，鸟兽之蜂蝶莺燕，宫室之台槛轩窗，器用之舟船壶杖，人事之梦忆愁恨，衣服之裙袖锦绮，饮食之茶浆饮酌，身体之须眉韵态，声色之红绿香艳，文史之骚赋题吟，数目之一三双半，皆无其字。《千字文》且然，况其他乎？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 111 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[110]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 112 则","author":"","text":"花不可见其落，月不可见其沉，美人不可见其夭。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 112 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[111]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 113 则","author":"","text":"种花须见其开，待月须见其满，著书须见其成，美人须见其畅适，方有实际。否则皆为虚设。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 113 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[112]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 114 则","author":"","text":"惠施多方，其书五车；虞卿以穷愁著书，今皆不传。不知书中果作何语？我不见古人，安得不恨！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 114 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[113]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 115 则","author":"","text":"以松花为粮，以松实为香，以松枝为麈尾，以松阴为步障，以松涛为鼓吹。山居得乔松百余章，真乃受用不尽。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 115 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[114]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 116 则","author":"","text":"玩月之法，皎洁则宜仰观，朦胧则宜俯视。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 116 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[115]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 117 则","author":"","text":"孩提之童，一无所知，目不能辨美恶，耳不能判清浊，鼻不能别香臭。至若味之甘苦，则不第知之，且能取之弃之。告子以甘食、悦色为性，殆指此类耳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 117 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[116]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 118 则","author":"","text":"凡事不宜刻，若读书则不可不刻；凡事不宜贪，若买书则不可不贪；凡事不宜痴，若行善，则不可不痴。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 118 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[117]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 119 则","author":"","text":"酒可好，不可骂座；色可好，不可伤生；财可好，不可昧心；气可好，不可越理。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 119 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[118]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 120 则","author":"","text":"文名可以当科第，俭德可以当货财，清闲可以当寿考。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 120 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[119]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 121 则","author":"","text":"不独诵其诗、读其书是尚友古人，即观其字画，亦是尚友古人处。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 121 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[120]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 122 则","author":"","text":"无益之施舍，莫过于斋僧；无益之诗文，莫甚于祝寿。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 122 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[121]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 123 则","author":"","text":"妾美不如妻贤，钱多不如境顺。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 123 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[122]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}}]